Link BLAS and LAPACK through FlexiBLAS, the BLAS of the foss toolchain, which does not allow linking a backend
of FlexiBLAS such as OpenBLAS directly.
FlexiBLAS also exports openblas_get_num_threads and openblas_set_num_threads, which gpridge calls,
and forwards them to its backend, OpenBLAS by default.
author: Rohit Goswami (rgoswami@ieee.org)
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -316,7 +316,7 @@
         endif
         gpr_optim_deps += openblas_static_dep
     else
-        openblas_dep = dependency('openblas', required: true)
+        openblas_dep = dependency('flexiblas', required: true)
         gpr_optim_deps += openblas_dep
         # Eigen's EIGEN_USE_LAPACKE calls the C wrappers. Some OpenBLAS
         # packages ship those in liblapacke rather than libopenblas.
